// Harmor's global effects (src/engine/gen/plugins/harmor/fx.ts and fx-*.ts)
// against FL Studio 2026's real plugin. Vectors come from the FL test host
// (scratchpad harmor/host): the same note rendered with all FX off (= FL's FX
// input, the part's FX / dry mix being 0) and with the FX settings of each case;
// the expected outputs are pinned as FNV-1a hashes of the float32 bits (-0
// counted as +0) plus a few sample values. Block lengths and voice counts are
// FL's render calls (512 frames, no preroll, note 60 vel 100 for 30 ms). The
// compression cases (types 1..4, forwarded params 821..824, automation) run the
// SGv2 port (fx-comp-sg.ts).
